      {
        "id": 11650,
        "name": "NHL 96",
        "summary": "NHL 96 was the first EA Sports game to feature Virtual Stadium technology, which resulted in a 3D feel and multiple camera angles. The NHL license ensures that real teams and players of the era are included, with a full league and playoff system. Many game options can be toggled - the infamous fighting is option, as are the penalties and offsides. The control system makes it possible to execute one-touch passes, and several special trick moves to quickly advance the ball. As a bonus feature, it included 'Hockey Card' profiles of every player on CD, and interviews with the stars of the game.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gox.jpg",
        "release_date": 812505600,
        "rating": 95.72058792066115,
        "rating_count": 21,
        "genres": "Sport",
        "platform_ids": "19,29,50,13,7",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nhl-96",
        "cached_at": 1772208554
      },
      {
        "id": 8257,
        "name": "Centurion: Defender of Rome",
        "summary": "The year is 275 B.C. Through conquest and careful diplomacy, the Roman republic has brought the petty kingdoms and city-states of Italia under its control. This is the moment at which the heirs of Romulus and Remus step onto the world stage. This is the humble beginning of an empire that will one day cover most of Europe, Asia Minor, and North Africa.\n\nAs an ambitious young officer, you duty is to defend Rome. Your hope is to become Caesar. Your fate - to rule the world.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zrp.jpg",
        "release_date": 662601600,
        "rating": 90.24791535655517,
        "rating_count": 16,
        "genres": "Strategy|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "149,29,13,118,16",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/centurion-defender-of-rome",
        "cached_at": 1772208554
      },
      {
        "id": 86,
        "name": "Dune II: The Building of a Dynasty",
        "summary": "Dune II is often considered the first mainstream modern real-time strategy game and established many conventions of the genre. Even though set in Frank Herbert's famous Dune universe, the game is only loosely connected to the plot of any of the books or the films based from them. Controlling either of the three Houses, the player must fight a number of battles against the other Houses. In the early levels, the goal is simply to earn a certain number of credits, while in the later missions, all enemies must be destroyed.\n\nThe single resource in the game is the Spice, which must be collected by harvesters. The spice is converted to credits in a refinery, which are then spent to construct additional buildings and units. There are two terrain types: buildings can only be constructed on stone, while the Spice is only found on sand. However, units moving on sand attract the large sandworms of Dune, who are virtually indestructible and can swallow even large units whole. As levels progress, new and more advanced buildings and units are made available, including structures like a radar station, a repair facility or defense turrets and, for units, various ground troops, light vehicles and tanks. Each House can construct one unique special unit, and, after building a palace improvement, can unleash a unique palace effect.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vw0.jpg",
        "release_date": 723168000,
        "rating": 90.03056872586998,
        "rating_count": 106,
        "genres": "Real Time Strategy (RTS)|Strategy",
        "platform_ids": "116,29,13,16",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dune-ii-the-building-of-a-dynasty",
        "cached_at": 1772208554
      },
      {
        "id": 15072,
        "name": "Landstalker",
        "summary": "You are Nigel, an elf and treasure hunter extraordinaire. Assisted by his new partner Friday, Nigel will travel to a distant island in a search of a legendary treasure.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kb9.jpg",
        "release_date": 720403200,
        "rating": 89.79759472400025,
        "rating_count": 25,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)",
        "platform_ids": "3,5,29,6,14",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/landstalker",
        "cached_at": 1772208554
      },
      {
        "id": 9232,
        "name": "Pirates! Gold",
        "summary": "As with the original, this is a blend of strategy, action and adventure. Pirates! Gold lets you play the role of a beginning buccaneer in the 17th century Spanish Main, in search of fame and fortune. Each town in this untamed raw region has different surprises and dangers.\n\nHow you acquire stature is up to you; you can make your living through honest trade and the search for hidden treasure, or you can be a little more daring and attack and plunder ships. As you can choose a specific skill to stand out in, the game can vary each time. Sword fighting is played out in side-view action sequences.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wp9.jpg",
        "release_date": 757296000,
        "rating": 89.64705649613876,
        "rating_count": 16,
        "genres": "Simulator|Strategy|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "114,29,6,14,13",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pirates-gold",
        "cached_at": 1772208554
      },
      {
        "id": 11219,
        "name": "Sonic the Hedgehog 3 & Knuckles",
        "summary": "Sonic the Hedgehog 3 & Knuckles (or simply Sonic 3 & Knuckles or Sonic 3 Complete Edition) is a platform video game which is the result of locking-on Sonic & Knuckles with Sonic the Hedgehog 3 using the former catridge's unique \"lock-on\" technology. It is essentially a large combined game of its two lock-on components and contains all Zones from the said games and also contains special features unique to this game. This would have been the original Sonic the Hedgehog 3 the developers intended but time constraints by Sega resulted in the game being split into two.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c0w.jpg",
        "release_date": 782438400,
        "rating": 89.09150213237751,
        "rating_count": 156,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "29,6",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sonic-the-hedgehog-3-and-knuckles",
        "cached_at": 1772208554
      },
      {
        "id": 5423,
        "name": "PowerMonger",
        "summary": "In a world without kings, power is the only law. No leader controls the destiny of this new world. Yet. Can you? Unite each territory by word or by sword or face bitter defeat at the hands of the other PowerMongers.\n\nEncounter a living world. Win the loyalty of farmers, shepherds, merchants, ranchers- even thieves. Hundreds of people with individual homes, jobs, and personalities.\n\nReact to changing seasons. Store food for the winter- your soldiers won't take orders on an empty stomach.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21zk.jpg",
        "release_date": 662601600,
        "rating": 88.98152932176808,
        "rating_count": 16,
        "genres": "Real Time Strategy (RTS)|Strategy",
        "platform_ids": "19,29,63,14,13,16,78",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/powermonger--1",
        "cached_at": 1772208554
      },
